    "ruleType": "enhancement",
    "group": "Carnival of Excess",
    "summary": "For a model that is EMPEROR'S CHILDREN or a KEEPER OF SECRETS (35 points). When the unit containing the bearer Advances, skip the Advance roll; its models instead add 6\" to their Move characteristic for the rest of the phase. Any model in the unit containing the bearer that makes a Normal move, an Advance move or a Fall Back move may pass through enemy models, entering Engagement Range of them if needed but never finishing the move inside it, and it passes any Desperate Escape test without rolling.",
